{"version": 1, "pages": [{"id": "review", "title": "Cycle 1 · All pages", "shapes": [{"id": "doc-title", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": -900, "w": 13120, "h": 240}, "text": "<p style='font-size:40pt;text-align:left'><b>Harvest Dashboard — Cycle 1 review · All pages</b><br><span style='font-size:20pt'>5 screens, left → right · Desktop 1440 wide (full page) · commit 8dd25b6 · <a href=\"https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app\">https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app</a> · harvested manually (no nightly routine)</span></p>"}, {"id": "legend-box", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": -600, "w": 2600, "h": 440}, "text": "<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>How to add anything</b><br>Put a sticky note INSIDE a grey frame and write what you want changed on that page of the dashboard. Harvests of this project are manual (Run harvest now on the current cycle page); safe requests are applied, committed and deployed. Start with <b>Do:</b> / <b>Must do</b>, <b>Try:</b> or <b>Consider:</b> to set priority (the words win over the colour); otherwise the colour counts. Purple = feedback about this board.<br><b>Stickies show your name — stay signed in.</b></p>"}, {"id": "legend-red", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 2700, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#FF8A80"}, "stroke": {"color": "#C62828", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Red</b><br>Do / Must do</p>"}, {"id": "legend-yellow", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3020, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#FFE066"}, "stroke": {"color": "#9A7B00", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Yellow</b><br>Try</p>"}, {"id": "legend-blue", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3340, "y": -570, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#A3E4FF"}, "stroke": {"color": "#1565C0", "widt